---
interface Props { source?: string }
const { source } = Astro.props;
const repo = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO;
const repoId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID;
const category = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY;
const categoryId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID;
const configured = Boolean(repo && repoId && category && categoryId);
const external = '<svg class="action-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3h7v7M21 3L10 14M10 3H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h16a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-6"/></svg>';
const heart = '<svg class="action-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg>';
---
<section class="discussion" aria-labelledby="discussion-heading">
  <h2 id="discussion-heading">좋아요와 댓글</h2>
  {configured ? (
    <div data-discussion data-repo={repo} data-repo-id={repoId} data-category={category} data-category-id={categoryId}>
      <p data-status aria-live="polite">GitHub 계정으로 이 글에 좋아요(👍 반응)를 누르거나 댓글을 남길 수 있어요. 버튼을 누르기 전에는 외부 위젯을 불러오지 않습니다.</p>
      <div class="discussion-actions">
        <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-open hidden><Fragment set:html={heart} /><span>좋아요·댓글 열기</span></button>
        <a class="button button-outline" href={`https://github.com/${repo}/discussions`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>GitHub Discussions</span><Fragment set:html={external} /></a>
      </div>
      <div class="giscus"></div>
    </div>
  ) : (
    <div>
      <p>댓글과 좋아요는 GitHub Discussions 연결을 마치면 열립니다.</p>
      {source && <div class="discussion-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href={source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Bear Blog 원문에서 공감하기</span><Fragment set:html={external} /></a></div>}
    </div>
  )}
</section>
